# Every network interface with a device behind it - by any name, cabled
# or not - gets its receive ring raised as it appears: at boot, on hotplug,
# after a driver reload. Bonds, VLANs, bridges and veths have no device and
# no ring of their own; their members are covered here. See nic-rx-ring.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="net", TEST=="device", RUN+="/usr/local/sbin/nic-rx-ring $attr{ifindex}"
